div.p:
The United States of America and the Peoples’ Republic of China are determined
                    that they should settle disputes between their two countries through peaceful
                    negotiations without resorting to the threat or use of force;

1. Neither this Announcement nor any of its provisions is to be construed as in
                    any way prejudicing the rights of either side or the position of either side
                    with respect to the merits of their disputes;
